<!-- LESSONS -->
<div class="page" id="lessons"><h2>12. Lessons Learned — Nov 19, 2026 Night Audit — v2.4</h2>
<div class="warn"><b>⛔ LOCAL ONLY — DO NOT UPLOAD THIS MASTER TO /public_html/</b><br>This Master contains password-exposure plan, vendor list, and prices. If uploaded, Google will find it. Keep in D:\Websites\... only.</div>
<h3>What We Discovered</h3><ul>
<li><b>1. 4 price systems live at once:</b> $5, $10, $15, and $150 for the same notary stamp. Sources: admin/pricing.php ($15), ratecard.html ($5), Social Kanban bios ($5 and $10), ratecard2.html ($150). — SEE CONFLICT #1</li>
<li><b>2. Internal tools were public:</b> Ratecards (Sedgwick pitch examples), Social Kanban (full launch plan), Vendor Portals (7 vendor logins list). None had a login.</li>
<li><b>3. Fake booking:</b> ratecard2.html claimed “blocked automatically when I'm on appointments” but book.php was commented out. It just opened SMS + email.</li>
<li><b>4. Placeholder live:</b> Calendar iframe was AcZssZx8p_example_replace_with_yours — live on site.</li>
<li><b>5. Server + email exposed:</b> gator4049.hostgator.com + ken@reliablenotaryct.us + Yahoo email in footers / code.</li>
<li><b>6. Old / test folders still live:</b> apostille-old, apostille-test, test, tools, ratecard folder — not audited yet, likely duplicates with old prices.</li>
<li><b>7. VIN collection in open chat:</b> ratecard2.html asked for VIN Last 6 in plain text box, sent via SMS/email, no privacy note.</li>
<li><b>8. quote.php bugs #85-#88:</b> Missing session_start(), session check bypass, missing pricing.php include, $51 math bug. — SEE CONFLICT #8</li></ul>
<h3>How We Prevent It</h3><ul>
<li><b>1. ONE price source:</b> admin/pricing.php only. Never hard-code $5 / $10 / $150 in a new file. — SEE CONFLICT #3</li>
<li><b>2. No internal files in /public_html/:</b> Local ONLY, or password-protected admin/. Never as public .html.</li>
<li><b>3. No server names, passwords, keys in any file:</b> No gator4049, no password, no api_key, no private calendar link in code.</li>
<li><b>4. No fake booking claims:</b> Never say “blocked automatically” unless real calendar blocking is tested.</li>
<li><b>5. No test / old folders live:</b> *-old, *-test, test/, tools/ get deleted or renamed to .BAK-PRIVATE the day testing ends.</li>
<li><b>6. No VIN / sensitive data in open forms:</b> VINs only via secure intake, not chat box + SMS.</li>
<li><b>7. Never log in from email:</b> Vendor logins only from typed URL or browser bookmark.</li>
<li><b>8. Quarantine, don't delete:</b> Rename to .BAK-PRIVATE first. Delete only after 30 days confirmed clean.</li></ul>
<p><b>Note on Locked #7 Pricing Line:</b> Locked #7 says $10 on-site. admin/pricing.php currently says $15. This conflict is NOT resolved yet. Do NOT publish new bios until ONE price is picked in §13.</p></div>

